WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.291
Sounds good, really good. 

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:02.166
Should we listen? 

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:02.666
Yeah.

00:00:02.791 --> 00:00:04.375
There's still a third verse
with those stops.

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:07.833
No, the stop before... 

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.583
Anybody wonders where the stop is,

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:12.708
watch me, I'll give you a cue.

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:14.916
We're having fun!

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:16.125
One.

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:17.083
Two. 

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:19.083
One, two, three.

